   "blocks": {
    "lead": {
     "type": "text",
     "blocks": {},
     "settings": {
      "text": "<h2>Every instrument began as somebody\u2019s stubborn question.</h2>",
      "width": "100%",
      "max_width": "normal",
      "alignment": "center",
      "type_preset": "h2",
      "font": "var(--font-heading--family)",
      "font_size": "",
      "line_height": "normal",
      "letter_spacing": "normal",
      "case": "none",
      "wrap": "balance",
      "text_color": "#1A1510",
      "background": false,
      "background_color": "#00000026",
      "corner_radius": 0,
      "padding-block-start": 0,
      "padding-block-end": 0,
      "padding-inline-start": 0,
      "padding-inline-end": 0
     }
    },
    "body": {
     "type": "text",
     "blocks": {},
     "settings": {
      "text": "<p><em>Some of this we sell; some we publish; all of it we learn in public. The orchard stages tell you where each one stands \u2014 Seedling still in the sand, Sapling branching out, fruit already in hand. What can be held, we sell. What is still becoming, we tend.</em></p><p>Questions are instruments of their own. The Atelier is where the research and the bench meet the curious.</p>",
      "width": "fit-content",
      "max_width": "none",
      "alignment": "center",
      "type_preset": "paragraph",
      "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
      "font_size": "",
      "line_height": "normal",
      "letter_spacing": "normal",
      "case": "none",
      "wrap": "balance",
      "text_color": "#1A1510D9",
      "background": false,
      "background_color": "#00000026",
      "corner_radius": 0,
      "padding-block-start": 0,
      "padding-block-end": 0,
      "padding-inline-start": 0,
      "padding-inline-end": 0
     }
    },
    "cta": {
     "type": "button",
     "blocks": {},
     "settings": {
